/*
 * Implements semantic validation of lambda prototypes.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of lambda parameter declarations,
 *   - validation of lambda return types,
 *   - detection of incomplete lambda prototypes,
 *   - construction of ProtoVarDeclValue entries for lambda parameters,
 *   - validation of reference and lazy modifiers,
 *   - enforcement of non-void and mutability rules,
 *   - error aggregation for multi-parameter validation.
 *
 * Lambda prototype validation is performed in a foreign context using the
 * current class referent, ensuring correct handling of type resolution and
 * local-scope insertion.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::lambda::proto
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/lambda/proto.yr
 * @Author(s):
